<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <!--
      Content Security Policy. Each allowance and why it exists:
      - default-src 'self': anything not listed below can only come from the app itself.
      - script-src 'self': only the bundled script runs (no CDN scripts, no inline scripts, no eval).
      - style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com: styled-components and the
        icon web component inject <style> tags at runtime (hence 'unsafe-inline'); the font CSS
        comes from Google Fonts.
      - font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com: the font files themselves.
      - img-src 'self' data: https://image.tmdb.org: TMDB artwork; data: for inline SVG.
      - frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com: the trailer player.
      - connect-src: the app makes no network calls from the page (TMDB goes through the main
        process). In development the dev server needs its hot-reload WebSocket.
      - object-src 'none', base-uri 'none', form-action 'none': features the app does not use.
    -->
    <meta
      http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
      content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https://image.tmdb.org<%= htmlWebpackPlugin.options.isDevelopment ? ' http://localhost:*' : '' %>; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; connect-src 'self'<%= htmlWebpackPlugin.options.isDevelopment ? ' ws://localhost:*' : '' %>; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"
    />
    <title>Movie Mates</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spartan:wght@200;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="root"></div>
  </body>
</html>
